# TripVerse Environment Configuration (Optional)
# Users can also configure API keys directly inside the TripVerse Web UI Settings (saved locally in browser localStorage).

# 1. Groq Cloud AI API Key (Powers AI Travel Assistant and Trip Planning)
# Get a free key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=

# 2. Tavily Search API Key (Enriches AI answers with real-time web search results) [Optional]
# Get a free key at: https://tavily.com/
VITE_TAVILY_API_KEY=

# 3. ExchangeRate API Key (For live foreign exchange rate conversions) [Optional]
# Get a free key at: https://www.exchangerate-api.com/
# (If omitted, TripVerse automatically uses the free open.er-api.com endpoint)
VITE_EXCHANGERATE_API_KEY=

# Public APIs used directly on the client (No keys needed):
# - OpenStreetMap Nominatim: https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/
# - Overpass API (Attractions & POIs): https://overpass-api.de/
# - Wikipedia REST API (Descriptions): https://en.wikipedia.org/
# - Open-Meteo Weather API (Forecasts): https://api.open-meteo.com/
